23
00:01:15,550 --> 00:01:17,756
First, the raw footage.

24
00:01:17,756 --> 00:01:20,155
The workflow is familiar:

25
00:01:20,155 --> 00:01:24,855
organize the clips, choose the strongest moments,

26
00:01:24,855 --> 00:01:28,692
build a sequence, add titles and motion,

27
00:01:28,692 --> 00:01:32,242
then export. The question is how much

28
00:01:32,242 --> 00:01:36,271
of that process the model can meaningfully

29
00:01:36,271 --> 00:01:37,326
