30
00:01:40,550 --> 00:01:42,549
Next, take selection.

31
00:01:42,549 --> 00:01:47,309
Instead of manually reviewing every repeated take,

32
00:01:47,309 --> 00:01:51,687
the system organizes the material and proposes

33
00:01:51,687 --> 00:01:53,496
a cleaner sequence.

34
00:01:53,496 --> 00:01:56,923
That can save time—but the final cut

35
00:01:56,923 --> 00:02:00,540
