57
00:03:20,550 --> 00:03:23,540
Sound is what makes these graphics feel

58
00:03:23,540 --> 00:03:26,683
finished. Music gives the piece momentum,

59
00:03:26,683 --> 00:03:30,899
while clicks, whooshes, and impacts emphasize important

60
00:03:30,899 --> 00:03:33,582
actions. The mix has to leave space

61
00:03:33,582 --> 00:03:36,802
for narration, so the music ducks whenever

62
00:03:36,802 --> 00:03:38,641
