63
00:03:40,550 --> 00:03:43,502
There’s also the practical side:

64
00:03:43,502 --> 00:03:46,914
setup, render time, and usage limits.

65
00:03:46,914 --> 00:03:49,497
These depend on the project,

66
00:03:49,497 --> 00:03:53,463
settings, and plan, so it’s worth measuring

67
00:03:53,463 --> 00:03:57,061
them instead of assuming every job will

68
00:03:57,061 --> 00:03:58,536
