69
00:04:00,550 --> 00:04:03,249
So how does Claude Opus 5.5 compare

70
00:04:03,249 --> 00:04:04,869
with ChatGPT 6 Astra?

71
00:04:04,869 --> 00:04:07,876
The useful answer comes from the actual

72
00:04:07,876 --> 00:04:10,498
