75
00:04:16,668 --> 00:04:20,138
One test isn’t a universal leaderboard—but it

76
00:04:20,138 --> 00:04:23,377
can reveal which workflow suits your work.

77
00:04:25,550 --> 00:04:28,458
For editors and motion designers,

78
00:04:28,458 --> 00:04:32,512
