80
00:04:35,067 --> 00:04:37,887
That leaves more time for story,

81
00:04:37,887 --> 00:04:41,412
taste, pacing, and the details that make

82
00:04:41,412 --> 00:04:43,615
a video feel intentional.

83
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:48,373
AI can accelerate the workflow.

84
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:53,601
But direction, judgment, and the final creative

85
00:04:53,601 --> 00:04:55,658
decisions still matter.

86
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,423
The future of video creation isn’t just

87
00:04:58,423 --> 00:04:59,638
